MODULE: AdmissionEqualBytesIdentity
TARGET: VersionIdentity
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: T mistakes equal bytes at a different HLC or tombstone kind for the prepared revision
PERTURBS: Confirm

--- FIND
    /\ classes' = [k \in Keys |-> Classify(source[k],k)]
--- REPLACE
    /\ classes' = [k \in Keys |-> IF source[k].bytes = Prepared[k].bytes THEN "prepared" ELSE Classify(source[k],k)]
--- END
